<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>At last our search has ended;</l><l>Our praises fill the air.</l><l>We’re the chosen generation!</l><l>Jesus loves this generation!</l><l>And the time has come</l><l>For all the young</l><l>To be in love with Him!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
